# Keep secrets and host-built artefacts out of the image.
#
# Critical: packages/server/.env holds the live Resend key. The Dockerfile does
# `COPY packages/server packages/server`, so without this file the secret would
# be baked into an image layer — recoverable by anyone who pulls the image.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Host-built artefacts. node_modules in particular would carry macOS-native
# binaries (incl. the darwin Prisma engine) into a Linux image and break it.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
**/.prisma
build
.expo

# VCS + tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Not needed to run the API
website
brand
packages/app
docs
*.md
!packages/server/**/*.md

# Local noise
.DS_Store
*.log
npm-debug.log*
coverage
.vscode
.idea
